- result: Mass infall rate S CrA = >=2.5e-8 (>=27 MJup/Myr) ± not stated Msun/yr [4.2 Physical parameters: "$\gtrsim2.5\times10^{-8}$ M$_{\odot}$ yr$^{-1}$ (or $\gtrsim27$ M$_{jupiter}$ Myr$^{-1}$) for S CrA"]
